# Compiled web bundle. Built by `make web` (real bundle, via Vite) or
# `make web-stub` (one-line index.html for tests that don't exercise the UI).
# Both populate internal/webapi/web/dist/ which is required by the
# go:embed directive in internal/webapi/embed.go. CI rebuilds this; we don't
# track it in git so the wire UI can't drift from the source.
internal/webapi/web/dist/
